 States Variables that represent the system configuration. Can be multiple state vectors: traj_multi = NamedTrajectory(
    (
        position = randn(3, N),  # 3D position
        velocity = randn(3, N),  # 3D velocity
        u = randn(2, N),
        Δt = fill(0.1, N),
    );
    timestep = :Δt,
